Cell["\<\
The relative entropy of a mixed state respect to a pure state is not finite:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9959959706258316`*^9, 3.995995970707201*^9}, {
  3.995996135246052*^9, 3.9959961732789116`*^9}},
